t it was wonderful, so I would like to request your help.\n\nThe illustration I would like to commission is of my favorite Vtuber, Luna Koishiro.\nI would like to have her in a cute swimsuit with a summery style that can be used for her YouTube thumbnail, X illustrations, icons, etc.\nHer image colors are white and pink, so I would like her swimsuit to be white or pink, light-colored pareo-like, but it is okay if it is slightly different.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with transparent PNG and PSD data of just the character.\n\nFor more information about Luna, please visit\nhttps://lit.link/kohakuruna\nPlease refer to the following link for more information.\n\nIf this is possible, we would appreciate your cooperation.\n\nhttps://lit.link/kohakuruna", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8kaze_/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2439908, "client_id": 3143812, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/980f6d8f/uploads/origins/06c73090-955a-48e7-af36-839c78596272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b693ad6902a129bc0de209a5a69c9d53", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/980f6d8f/uploads/origins/06c73090-955a-48e7-af36-839c78596272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b693ad6902a129bc0de209a5a69c9d53, https://si.imgix.net/980f6d8f/uploads/origins/06c73090-955a-48e7-af36-839c78596272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c0bfe6bd070310a1c4275ebea5d8926 2x, https://si.imgix.net/980f6d8f/uploads/origins/06c73090-955a-48e7-af36-839c78596272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=662548ec36b6e3751b0f4a0308ac4262 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/980f6d8f/up